  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「結局、校内のあちこちを探したけど、いなかったね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「学院は広いから……園芸部の畑とか、そういう、校庭よりも外のほうに行ってるのかもしれないけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「今日は、コートが空っぽだね。珍しい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「バスケ部の練習は、ないのかって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「そうだね……コートの利用は室内系の球技部でローテーションしてるんだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「もしかしたら、バレー部はこないだ試合があったから、視聴覚室で試合のビデオを見てるのかも」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「せっかくだから、バスケでもしてみる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「うん。体格差はそこまでハンデにはならないと思うし、別に大丈夫」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「むしろ……わたしより強い選手がいたら、会ってみたいくらいだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「わたし、運動神経がいいみたいだから。それこそいろいろな種目の競技をやってきたけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「どれもこれも、簡単に勝てて、つまらなかったんだよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「だけど……バスケなら」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「身長がかなりのハンデになってくれると思って、続けられた」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「自らに課題を課すことで、わたしは楽しむことができたんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
